# Godot
.godot/
*.import
# The addon body lives at the repo ROOT since SEE-1268 T1 (no godot/ tree).
# Track the addon's script .uid sidecars so its resource identity is stable
# across machines (a missing sidecar makes any uid:// reference fall back to
# path with a load warning). See Godot VCS docs / 4.4 release notes.
*.uid
!*.gd.uid
!*.tscn.uid
!plugin.cfg.uid

# Environment
.env
.env.local

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

